' The stage set for the VBFLXGRD18 section: the control instance its samples assume.
'
' A sample on a VBFlexGrid page says `VBFlexGrid1.Rows = 10`, which is form code-behind: the
' reader has a form with a VBFlexGrid on it, named VBFlexGrid1 by the designer. This
' template's Form1 is such a form (Form1.tbform), and this property gives every sample the
' grid on it, so that a sample that is run works on a real grid. Reading it loads Form1.
'
' The Load is explicit: on BETA 1042 a grid reached through the form's implicit
' instance, `Form1.VBFlexGrid1` with Form1 not loaded, raises -2147467262 (No such
' interface supported) at its first property.
'
' The type is written `VBFLXGRD18.VBFlexGrid`, the project's name and then the class's.

Module tbxStageVBFlexGrid

    Public Property Get VBFlexGrid1() As VBFLXGRD18.VBFlexGrid
        Load Form1
        Return Form1.VBFlexGrid1
    End Property

End Module
